$===============================================================
PROJ 'chile' 't0'

SET LEVEL 1.00
SET NAUTICAL
SET DEPMIN 5
COORDINATES SPHErical
MODE NONSTationary TWODimensional

$======================== ENTRADA ===============================         
CGRID UNSTRUCTURED CIRCLE 36 0.0345 0.6666 24

READ UNSTRUCTURED triangle '../malla/chile_250k' 
INPGRID BOTTOM UNSTRUCTURED 
READINP BOTTOM -1.0 '../malla/chile_250k.bot' 3 0 FREE

INPGRID WIND REG -84.0 -50.0 0.0 34 80 0.5 0.5  NONSTATionary FECHA_INI 3.0 HR FECHA_FIN
READINP WIND 1 '../bound/vientos.bot' 3 0 1 1 FREE

$BOUNDARY CON ESPECTROS
